   551	\subsection{GSM8K Results}
   552	\label{sec:gsm8k_results}
   553	
   554	Tables~\ref{tab:results_gsm8k} and~\ref{tab:heldout_gsm8k} report GSM8K
   555	evidence from two complementary angles: (i) a secondary cross-source summary
   556	that mixes protocols and should be read as descriptive context, and (ii) a
   557	held-out test-set evaluation of the
   558	ten Tinker checkpoints whose training \emph{last-10} reward was highest.
   559	The held-out evaluation partially checks whether \emph{last-10} reward survives
   560	outside the rollout distribution, but it remains a checkpoint-selection analysis.
   561	
